.Dd October 4, 2026
.Dt AUDIO-OUTPUT-OSD 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm audio-output-osd
.Nd show the audio-output glyph
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm Cm speakers
.Nm Cm headphones
.Nm Cm headphones: Ns Ar n
.Nm Cm all
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
shows the output glyph through
.Xr bosd 1 .
.Cm speakers
is the speaker glyph.
.Cm headphones
is the headphone glyph.
.Cm headphones: Ns Ar n
with
.Ar n
at least 2 adds that number as a badge.
.Cm all
is the speaker glyph with an All badge.
.Pp
The glyph stays up for
.Ev AUDIO_OUTPUT_OSD_HOLD
seconds.
The default is 1.4.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "AUDIO_OUTPUT_OSD_HOLD"
.It Ev AUDIO_OUTPUT_OSD_HOLD
Seconds the glyph stays up.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr audio-output-toggle 1 ,
.Xr bosd 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Devin Teske Aq Mt dteske@FreeBSD.org
